  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Cement or Portland cement mainly contains oxides of calcium, silicon, aluminium, and iron. When water is mixed with cement, the oxides get hydrated, and cement sets extremely fast. To control the setting time of cement, gypsum is added to it, which increases the setting time of cement.</p></blockquote>",
